# MaCSad admin console

Import AdminApp from "./admin_app.lg".
Import AdminHeader from "./admin_header.lg".
Import AdminPolicy from "./admin_policy.lg".
Import BoardWorkspace from "./board_workspace.lg".
Import ReadOnlyPanels from "./read_only_panels.lg".

The production entry composes the imported administrative component. Behavior,
state, and styling remain authored in LOGOS; this file owns only page mounting.
The complete reachable closure is also imported here as a pinned-compiler
scope-attribution compatibility lock; logical dependencies remain module-local.

## Main
Render:
    css "html, body, #root { width: 100%; min-height: 100%; } body { max-width: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }"
Mount MacsAdAdmin at "#root".
